WEBVTT

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:10.250
Everyone is panicking to gain entry

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:14.620
into the Junior Youth Championship, 
but Mieru is fine.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:18.240
Because my fortune says that I'll gain entry

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.430
by winning my sixth 
consecutive match tomorrow.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.930
And...

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.670
What's this?

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:27.960
Mieru.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.110
Oh my!

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.120
I'll meet my soulmate of destiny?

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.320
Oh my!  Mieru can't handle it!

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:48.430
Right now, you're still 
within my expectations.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:50.600
Within expectations...

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:55.630
A pro surpasses the audience's expectations.

00:00:55.630 --> 00:01:00.370
In the next match, I want you to astound me!

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.640
Astound him...

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:10.050
But I don't know how!

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:13.440
It's no good.  I can't see anything.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:18.280
I can't see my path, my future, 
or what's beyond Pendulum Summon.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:27.080
I have to return this card 
to Yuzu as soon as possible.

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:35.210
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:40.090
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:43.080
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:47.390
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:06.170
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:09.580
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:18.320
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:22.890
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:25.090
Impulse  Got it got it

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:30.300
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:41.040
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:47.980
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:51.920
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:55.320
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:02:55.320 --> 00:03:05.600
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.940
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:18.980
Fortunetelling Girl  Mieru Houchun

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.250
Be quiet!

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:35.770
Ouch!  What do you want?

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.200
I overslept!

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:40.770
Oh no!  I'll be late for the duel!

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:43.900
My cards!

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:47.470
Did I also leave them on my desk?

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:51.110
I don't have time for this!

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:05.620
Mieru's soulmate will soon arrive.

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:08.570
I wonder what he's like?

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:11.400
A super cool elite duelist?

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.770
Or a wild beefcake?

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:17.300
I can also go for a kind family man!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:22.770
Hurry up and get here, Mieru's soulmate!

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:30.980
This is the address that Nico gave me.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:40.030
Is this the right place?

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:42.370
Unno Fortunetelling School?

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:44.500
Yuya...

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:46.470
It's a ghost!

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.050
Oh it's you, Nico.

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:52.350
I was waiting for you, Yuya.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:59.210
Why is the stairway so dark?

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:02.400
Yuya, watch your step.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.780
I know-

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.570
What happened?

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:21.800
He's the worst.

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:26.340
You lucky pervert!

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.710
Unacceptable!

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:34.620
This guy is Mieru's soulmate of destiny?

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.250
But wait, Mieru.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:42.080
Up to now, Mieru has used her 
fortunetelling to see the future.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:44.620
When I was lost...

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.630
During a test...

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.250
Even today's weather.

00:05:56.820 --> 00:06:00.710
Mieru's fortunetelling has 
never been wrong, so this time-

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.140
Hey you.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:04.220
What?  You're so noisy!

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:06.910
Umm, should we start the duel?

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:09.110
Fine!  I'll duel!

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:14.590
I'll duel you to predict whether 
you are Mieru's soulmate!

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:18.660
Everyone, thanks for waiting!

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:22.600
Yuya Sakaki displays amazing 
entertainment dueling,

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:25.830
and Mieru Houchun's 
fortunetelling is never wrong!

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:29.330
Their official match will now begin!

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:33.070
Principal Unno, give us a few words!

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.660
Destiny is already determined,

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:42.770
but people don't know their 
fate because time is linear.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:46.310
Fortunetelling is a flame that guides people.

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:50.140
It's the microcosm of a person's life.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:53.910
Action Field on!

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:56.460
The Field Spell Fortuneterror activates!

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:14.480
Something is carved into the pillars!

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:18.120
Death, The Magician, The Hanged Man...

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.910
They're tarot cards!

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.690
How mystical!

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:23.540
We're going to duel here?

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.820
Yes.

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:28.410
My fortunetelling duels are never wrong,

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:32.400
and I'll use it to determine 
whether you're Mieru's soulmate.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.310
Soulmate?  What do you mean-

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:35.570
Let's begin!

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:39.470
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:41.680
Along with their monsters,

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:45.240
they'll kick the ground and fly through 
the sky to move around the field!

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:48.580
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.450
Action!

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:51.570
Duel!

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:58.910
We'll flip a coin to 
determine who goes first.

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:02.710
Heads is a dragon.  Tails is the devil.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:07.800
If you pick correctly, you 
get to choose who goes first.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:13.710
Which is it?

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.960
Umm...

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.140
I choose dragon!

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.880
Too bad.  It's the devil.

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:21.710
Huh?

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:25.520
I knew you were pathetic and 
couldn't see the future.

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:28.650
I had a 50% chance of being 
wrong.  That's all it was!

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:32.320
Mieru can see the future, 
and she'll go first!

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:38.570
Mieru sets one monster in defense position!

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.330
Set in defense position?

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:47.270
It's scary when you don't 
know what was summoned.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:49.980
Mieru ends her turn.

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:52.370
That's it?

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:58.580
When this card is revealed, 
you will witness our destiny.

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:02.400
What's this destiny thing 
you keep talking about?

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.740
You'll find out eventually.

00:09:04.740 --> 00:09:08.290
It's your turn, Mr. I-Can't-See-the-Future.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:10.800
Sheesh!  Be quiet!

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:12.800
My turn!

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:15.530
Something troubles you.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:19.300
Trouble?  How do you know?

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:23.660
During the coin flip, you chose dragon.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:28.480
That symbolizes your desire to use power 
to break out of your current predicament.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:33.380
You're currently stuck and can't do anything.

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:38.540
She's right.  I want to find out 
what's beyond Pendulum Summon.

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:42.340
But right now, I must use all 
my strength in this duel!

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:44.880
I draw!

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:48.030
All right!  It's Odd-Eyes!

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:52.450
I can set the Pendulum Scale from 1 to 4.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:56.800
But I only have Level 5-and-above 
monsters in my hand,

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.680
so I can't summon them either.

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.300
I can't do anything with this hand!

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.970
I end my turn.

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:07.750
Like I thought.

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:12.570
What?  He didn't summon 
a monster or set a card?

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:14.940
What's wrong with Yuya?

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:16.730
Does he have bad cards?

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:18.650
In this situation...

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.220
I have to get an Action Card!

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:32.510
It should be around here.  Where is it?

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:37.110
Hello?

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:40.020
Yuzu!  Where are you?

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:41.580
What am I doing?

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:46.340
When I win my sixth consecutive match today, 
I can enter the Junior Youth Championship!

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:48.380
You have to watch!

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.170
Yeah, but...

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.400
No excuses!  Hurry up and come!

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:53.400
Okay!

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:56.280
It's Mieru's turn!  I draw!

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:02.280
I Flip Summon my set monster!

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:06.540
Appear, Prediction Princess Coinorma!

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:13.420
Coinorma's Flip Effect activates!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.450
Flip Effect?

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:19.220
It's an effect that activates 
when a card turns faceup.

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:23.000
Monsters with that effect 
are called Flip Monsters.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.100
When Coinorma is flipped faceup,

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:30.670
I can set one Level 4-or-below Flip 
Monster in my deck, hand or graveyard.

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:34.400
Mieru sets this card!

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.340
She set another card?

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:44.100
Coinorma will tell your fortune as 
you run around with nowhere to go.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.460
Heads, tails, tails.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:54.830
It means you will face a choice of destiny.

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:58.200
Yuya's field is empty.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:01.160
If nothing changes, he'll 
take a direct attack!

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:03.370
If he only had an Action Card...

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:04.860
Let's battle!

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:06.740
Coinorma attacks you directly!

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:09.500
There it is!

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.400
I can do something with this!

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:13.350
There are two!

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:17.160
You can only add one 
Action Card to your hand.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:19.820
This is your choice of destiny.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.230
Which should I choose?

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:23.030
This one!

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.360
Lousy Luck?

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:29.330
The Action Trap Lousy Luck 
deals you 800 points of damage.

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.900
Too bad!

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:40.400
The odds of getting Lousy 
Luck is over 10,000-to-1.

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:42.980
You have horrible luck.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:51.050
Her fortune came true!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:53.460
I'm not done.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:56.480
Mieru tributes Coinorma

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:59.860
to Tribute Summon one card from her 
hand in facedown defense position.

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:04.360
Tribute Summon facedown in defense position?

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:07.290
That's right.  This card 
represents the future,

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:09.060
which is something you know nothing about.

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:13.310
Mieru sets one card and ends her turn.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:15.530
I'll succeed this time!

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:17.360
My turn!

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:18.710
I drew it!

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:22.540
I summon Performapal Bowhopper from my hand!

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:28.860
Both her monsters are facedown.

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:33.800
But the one that she Tribute Summoned 
must have the higher Level.

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.800
Don't even try.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:40.100
Since you're unlucky, something 
bad will definitely happen.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:42.700
I've heard enough from you!  Let's battle!

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:48.960
Performapal Bowhopper attacks the 
facedown monster that you set first!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:53.100
I activate the trap card Black Cat-astrophe.

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:00.820
Black cats are glaring 
at him!  That's bad luck!

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:02.320
And there are thirteen cats!

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:14.770
When I have two or more set monsters, 
Black Cat-astrophe ends your battle!

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:16.060
No way!

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:22.740
Ouch...  Why did I suddenly trip?

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:26.450
I told you that something bad would happen.

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:28.860
I only tripped!

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:33.000
I've never seen Black Cat-astrophe 
produce so many cats.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.920
You must have no luck at all.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.390
I end my turn.

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:42.800
I tried to warn you, but you ignored me.

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:51.400
I'm now certain that you 
are not Mieru's soulmate.

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:54.870
I'll erase you until there's 
nothing left!  Prepare yourself!

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:57.200
You really have no filter.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:14:59.350
It's Mieru's turn!  I draw!

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:03.750
Mieru Flip Summons her set monster!

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:06.220
Appear!

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:10.620
Prediction Princess Arrowsylph!

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:14.190
When Arrowsylph flips up,

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:19.280
I can add a Ritual Spell from 
my deck or graveyard to my hand.

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:20.630
Ritual Spell?

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:26.370
Mieru adds the Ritual Spell 
Prediction Ritual to her hand!

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:31.310
Next, I Flip Summon the set monster 
that I Tribute Summoned earlier!

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:35.480
You're up, Prediction Princess Crystaldine!

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:38.750
When Crystaldine is flipped up,

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:43.520
I add a Ritual Monster in my 
deck or graveyard to my hand.

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:48.130
Mieru adds Prediction Princess 
Tarotrei to her hand!

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:52.480
She added a Ritual Spell and 
a Ritual Monster in her hand!

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:53.720
What's that mean?

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:55.480
A Ritual Summon!

00:15:55.480 --> 00:16:00.010
She will summon a high-Level Ritual 
Monster using a Ritual Spell!

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:03.960
Crystaldine will tell your fortune.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:14.060
I see great power surrounding 
you in a cloud of darkness.

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:19.590
Mieru activates the Ritual Spell 
Prediction Ritual from her hand!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:36.380
Due to its effect, I tribute Level 4 
Arrowsylph and Level 5 Crystaldine.

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:40.560
The two tributed monsters' Level equals 9.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:47.280
Therefore, I can Ritual Summon Level 
9 Prediction Princess Tarotrei!

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:50.720
The ancient sorceress who sees everything!

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:54.530
The ancient secret spell resurrects you!

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:56.660
Ritual Summon!

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:04.880
Level 9 Prediction Princess Tarotrei!

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:10.640
So this is a Ritual Monster!

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:12.480
Let's battle!

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:16.360
Prediction Princess Tarotrei 
attacks Bowhopper!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.090
Yuya!

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:31.600
Mieru sets one monster and ends her turn.

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:33.160
It's no good.

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:35.600
My future is entirely dark...

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:38.140
No!  I can't be emotionally weak!

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:41.040
I will win!  I have to win!

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:45.480
I'll win and enter the Junior Youth 
Championship and become a pro!

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:48.950
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:50.650
All right!

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:52.960
I don't care about fortunes!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.590
I won't let them mislead me!

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.160
Yuya!

00:17:58.160 --> 00:17:59.560
Pendulum is coming!

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:07.240
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:25.120
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:28.090
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:30.880
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:32.920
Pendulum Summon!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:35.480
Come out, my monsters!

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:42.130
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:49.440
Performapal Elephammer!

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:53.360
Performapal Kaleidoscorp!

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.680
Performapal Partnaga!

00:18:57.620 --> 00:19:00.280
Performapal Springoose!

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:06.560
Summoning many monsters 
at once gives me shivers!

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:08.430
He'll now turn the tables!

00:19:08.800 --> 00:19:10.160
That's bad luck.

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:11.780
What now?

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:13.000
Since you don't understand,

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:17.040
Mieru will read your future 
using your card arrangement.

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.770
Read my future using my card arrangement?

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:25.440
First, the dragon placed in the center

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:29.160
symbolizes that you're in 
a very precarious position.

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:32.520
The elephant represents big power.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:37.040
The bird symbolizes that 
your emotions are rising.

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:40.400
But the scorpion is an 
obstacle hiding at your feet.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:45.320
And the snake says that 
it's wickedly cunning.

00:19:45.320 --> 00:19:49.440
In other words, your future will be...

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:53.000
A huge failure.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:56.480
And your future is wrapped in darkness.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.140
A huge failure...

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:03.040
Yuya!  Don't believe that fortune!

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:06.000
But all her fortunes have 
been correct so far!

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.360
Well...

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:10.420
It's so occult that it gives me shivers!

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:15.090
I will change that future!

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.830
Yuya!

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:20.070
Your destiny is already determined.

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:23.680
When Partnaga is summoned 
or Special Summoned,

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:26.520
I select one monster on my field.

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:32.840
It gains 300 attack points for 
every Performapal on my field!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:36.220
Yuya has four Performapals on his field!

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:38.960
It gains 1200 attack points!

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.440
Let's battle!

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:47.590
Odd-Eyes attacks Tarotrei!

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:50.060
I activate Tarotrei's effect!

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:52.530
Once during your turn,

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:56.440
this card can switch my set monster from 
defense position to attack position.

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:59.740
What?  Flip Summon during 
the opponent's turn?

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:05.400
Awaken, Prediction Princess Petalelf!

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:14.450
When this card flips up, all your 
monsters switch to defense position!

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:15.940
What?

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:24.160
And your monsters can't change 
battle position this turn!

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:25.440
No way!

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:28.900
Tarotrei will now read your future.

00:21:41.950 --> 00:21:45.700
Tarotrei reveals The Tower right-side up.

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:50.620
This card symbolizes destruction, 
falling and tragedy.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.910
You must give up.

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:07.000
If you continue, you may lose your life!

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:18.910
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:28.390
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.280 --> 00:22:40.400
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:45.640
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:51.080
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.330 --> 00:22:56.340
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.540 --> 00:23:01.940
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:06.360
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:12.330
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:17.740
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.740 --> 00:23:23.040
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:32.380
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:40.630
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:46.110 --> 00:23:47.860
You must give up!

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:51.880
If you continue, you may lose your life!

00:23:51.880 --> 00:23:54.280
What?  My life?

00:23:54.280 --> 00:23:57.250
I won't believe that nonsense!

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:01.600
Don't oppose your destiny!  Surrender!

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:04.620
My destiny hasn't been determined.

00:24:04.620 --> 00:24:07.420
I'll create my own future!

00:24:07.770 --> 00:24:11.430
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
The Mysterious Eye

00:24:11.430 --> 00:24:13.670
The fun is only getting started!
